  "releaseNotes": "0.6.3 adds graphics operations: levels and gamma, Pillow-exact AutoContrast and Equalize, read-only histograms (GetHistogram), trimming of transparent or background-colored margins (AutoCrop, FindTrimBounds), alpha masks (ApplyMask) and the twelve W3C separable blend modes in DrawImageOptions.BlendMode. Default results are unchanged. Notes: https://github.com/art-ix/PictureSharp/blob/v0.6.3/docs/releases/release-0.6.3.md",
